Install Tricore toolchain then rustup 

Configure environment variables: 

-----PATH VARIABLE-----
C:\HighTec\toolchains\rust\v0.1.0\bin
C:\Program Files\DAS64\clients ---Tricore access a folder/dll in here.
C:\HighTec\toolchains\rust\v0.1.0\license.lic ---Link to wherever the license files is located.

DAS_HOME ---Should be set automatically
C:\Program Files\DAS64

Tricore probe executable: C:\Users\jeffe\Desktop\examples\tricore-probe\target\debug\ --- Copy to work directory and add runner in toml file
Tricore probe demo-code: C:\Users\jeffe\Desktop\examples\tc37x-demo-main

