Example Codes: 
C:\Users\jeffe\Desktop\examples\rust-tc375-lite-kit-example\target\tc162-htc-none\release\examples

rustup override set tricore ---needs to be set in order to compile to tricore targets

---A folder and file named .conf/config needs to be created in the root of the directoy. 
[target.tc162-htc-none]
rustflags = ["-C", "link-args=-Llinker-scripts -Ttc37xA_memory.ld"]

[build]
target = "tc162-htc-none"


Convert .elf file to .hex file using: objcopy -O ihex ./target/tc162-htc-none/release/examples/blinking_led_1.elf output.hex

output.hex can then be flashed using memtool

Important ressources: 
https://github.com/lobaro/FreeRTOS-rust/tree/master ---An already existing FreeRTOS implementation that utilises cc
https://github.com/veecle
https://github.com/veecle/tc37x-demo ---tricore-probe demo
https://github.com/veecle/tricore-probe ---tricore-probe
https://github.com/Infineon/tc375-pac/tree/master ---svd file